  "title": "Escape Research team found a PII disclosure in Keycloak. It's now CVE-2026-17059.",
  "summary": "Keycloak filters its main users list so a restricted admin sees nothing. The endpoint that lists a role's members skips that filter and hands the same account everyone's email and name. Escape research found it, reported it, and it's now tracked as CVE-2026-17059.",
